@startuml
title Sequence Diagram - Menu Management

actor Manager
participant "Admin UI" as UI
participant "Product API" as Product
database DB

Manager -> UI : create or edit product
UI -> Product : POST/PUT /api/products
Product -> DB : validate and save product
alt upload image
  Product -> Product : store uploaded image
end
DB --> Product : saved record
Product --> UI : success response
UI --> Manager : show updated menu
@enduml
